<object #orders.order kind="entity" fact_grade="authoritative_fact" single_writer="modeling://domain/orders/orders_module" [
  <desc ?>
  一张订单：从下单到履约的聚合根。状态由事件投影，金额是只读派生。
  </?>
  <types ?ts_order>
  interface Order {
    id: string
    customerId: string
    status: OrderStatus
    lines: OrderLine[]
    total: Money          // 只读投影：由 lines 计算，不反写
  }
  interface OrderLine { sku: string; qty: number; unitPrice: Money }
  </?ts_order>
  <fact-source ?>
  唯一写入者 = orders_module；total 是 derived_projection_cache，由 lines 投影，不反写。
  </?>
  <invariants ?>
  同一 order 内 sku 不重复；total = Σ(line.qty × line.unitPrice)；删除走软删 cancelled。
  </?>
  <not-owned-here ?>
  库存扣减属 inventory context，本节点经 message 请求，不直写。
  </?>
]>

<enum #orders.order_status kind="enum" [
  <types ?ts_status>
  enum OrderStatus { Draft="draft", Placed="placed", Paid="paid", Shipped="shipped", Cancelled="cancelled" }
  </?ts_status>
]>

<state-machine #orders.order_lifecycle kind="state-machine" [
  <desc ?>
  订单状态机：合法迁移与触发事件。
  </?>
  <mermaid ?mm_life>
  stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft
    draft --> placed: place
    placed --> paid: pay
    paid --> shipped: ship
    draft --> cancelled: cancel
    placed --> cancelled: cancel
  </?mm_life>
]>

<policy #orders.pricing kind="policy" behaviors=["behavior://orders/requirements/coupon-validation"] [
  <desc ?>
  定价与折扣规则：跨 order line 的金额计算与优惠券校验。
  </?>
  <pseudo kind="rule" ?ps_price>
  applicable(coupon, order) :- valid(coupon), total(order, T), T >= coupon.minSpend.
  discount(order, D)        :- applicable(C, order), D = C.amount.
  </?ps_price>
]>
